  "body": "Together when you want to be, with space when you need it. Beautifully renovated throughout, this big family home has bedrooms, living and a bathroom on each level, making it a great fit for extended family. Whether you're making room for adult kids and grandkids, or giving teenagers a space of their own, the layout makes it easy to live together.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the stunning brand-new kitchen, dining and living area share one open-plan space that flows onto a private, sun-soaked deck framed by lush tropical landscaping. It's the kind of spot where a summer barbecue turns into an evening with friends. Three bedrooms and a beautifully updated bathroom complete this level.\r\n\r\nDownstairs is where the layout really comes into its own. A fourth bedroom, second bathroom, recreation room and games room (currently set up as a 5th bedroom), plus a large laundry give you plenty of ways to use the space. Give teenagers their own semi self contained hangout, make room for adult kids and grandkids, or set up a home office away from the bustle upstairs.\r\n\r\nSet on a 782m2; freehold section, there's a closed in carport and plenty of off-street parking, including space for the boat, trailer or caravan. Torbay Village cafes and shops are close by, and Glamorgan School is just a 400 m walk away.\r\n\r\nAt a glance:\r\n\r\n* Four bedrooms and two bathrooms across two levels\r\n* Beautifully renovated throughout, with a brand-new kitchen\r\n* Open-plan living and dining flowing onto a private, sun-soaked deck with lush tropical landscaping\r\n* Downstairs games room, a recreation room and large laundry create a flexible retreat for teenagers or extended family\r\n* 782 m2; freehold section\r\n* Enclosed carport and plenty of off-street parking, with room for a boat, trailer or caravan\r\n* Close to Torbay Village cafes and shops & just a 400m walk to Glamorgan School\r\n* Zoned for Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n\r\nAll the hard work's been done- just move in and enjoy. Our sellers are committed and instruct a sale before Christmas- act fast!\r\n\r\nAuction: Thursday 03 12 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\nLocation: Ray White Milford, in rooms 5:00pm\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG36199",
